PROOF-FRONTIER READOUT
readout_1=AP/doubled-AP are the only maximizers of lambda2 and total positive
  conductance, and the only minimizers of Kirchhoff/mean/max Green resistance.
readout_2=the HYP-3202 exchange traps have large effective-resistance excesses;
  their primary Green discharges split between maxR bottlenecks, lambda2 loss,
  Kirchhoff excess, and negative leakage.
readout_3=Green conductance is a strong new dictionary coordinate, but the
  positive-part construction is lossy; a proof must keep negative covariance
  leakage and odd Worpitzky sidecars.
